 pick both Maya and Ayumi to be Helen and they will alternate who plays Helen during the run.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-08-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1xoQdQDrDblOVoKaFSDkx5gaN6c.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1xoQdQDrDblOVoKaFSDkx5gaN6c.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/35175/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"798210","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Ayumi and Maya both perform their versions of Helen for the Theater Festival; Ayumi is first to perform.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-09-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tGfV1mOog0bcPUEFEsrIa17y7El.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tGfV1mOog0bcPUEFEsrIa17y7El.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/35175/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"798202","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After Maya accepts the award for Best Supporting Actress, Tsukikage comes onstage and offers both Maya and Ayumi the chance to play the lead role in \"The Scarlet Angel\".","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-09-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b3Q8bILbfIXN8nh2eG1Mb6CvY4z.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b3Q8bILbfIXN8nh2eG1Mb6CvY4z.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/35175/season/1/episode/24"},{"id":"798201","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Episodio 25","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Masumi's people have found Maya's Mother but Masumi decides to keep that information to himself. Maya starts to realize how jealous people are of her success.","l